{
setup_dma();
// XXX add 2016-09-01
init_dma_list();
fill_dma_item(0);
// end XXX add
start_timer();
}
Line Endings
Commits should only contain files with LF (Unix style) endings.
Windows users can configure git to check out CRLF (Windows style) endings locally and commit LF endings by
setting the core.autocrlf setting. Github has a document about setting this option <github-line-endings>.
